    <Comments>https://github.com/adempiere/adempiere/issues/4257
      Feature request

      Generate Import Format From Print Format Report allows you to generate an Import Loader Format from a print format for a specific import table.

      This functionality is very useful because you can design a print format that requires importing in the desired order of the fields, export the report to a spreadsheet and based on the order of the fields generate an Import Loader Format, this is generally is done manually.

      Describe the solution you'd like

      1.- Create a new process with the pararamenter to Print format
      2.- The process use the Table from print format and create an Import Loader Format with same order and fields setting a print formaqt

      Describe alternatives you've considered

      Now you need create the Import Loader Format manuality </Comments>
